OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FFifa president Gianni Infantino is
OL,8,Fstill fighting for his job, and battle
OL,9,Flines are being drawn up as the
OL,10,Felection for his final term looms.
OL,12,FUntil a few weeks ago, Infantino
OL,13,Fseemed assured of continuing as Fifa
OL,14,Fpresident in the upcoming vote,
OL,15,Fscheduled for March 2027.
OL,17,FBut the crisis over his Fifa Forward
OL,18,FEnterprise (FFE) plan to invite
OL,19,Fprivate companies to invest in the
OL,20,FWorld Cup has triggered fury around
OL,21,Fthe world.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786376899
OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FThe plan has now been shelved, but the
OL,8,Fanger it generated has not gone away.
OL,10,FInfantino has fought back, and this
OL,11,Fweek he secured the backing of Fifa's
OL,12,Ftop executives at a crisis meeting in
OL,13,FRabat, Morocco.
OL,15,FBut ultimately the power to oust
OL,16,FInfantino lies with the 211 national
OL,17,Ffootball associations that make up
OL,18,FFifa.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
