OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FEach nation has one vote, meaning
OL,8,Fsupport from small nations like San
OL,9,FMarino and the Bahamas is equal to
OL,10,Fbacking from big hitters like Brazil
OL,11,Fand England.
OL,13,FFootball groups like Uefa, the union
OL,14,Fof European associations, can support
OL,15,Fa candidate and lobby for their
OL,16,Fmembers to back one as a group, but
OL,17,Fthe final decision lies with each
OL,18,Fnation.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
