OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786376899
OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FUefa has been vocal in its criticism
OL,8,Fof Infantino, but the other groups
OL,9,Flike the Confederation of African
OL,10,FFootball are backing the president.
OL,12,FNo one has yet come forward to
OL,13,Fpublicly challenge Infantino in the
OL,14,Fvote, with the final date for
OL,15,Fcandidates to enter the election set
OL,16,Ffor November 18.
OL,18,FITV News unpacks which national
OL,19,Ffootball associations are for - or
OL,20,Fagainst - Infantino.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
