OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786376899
OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FWho is calling for Infantino to go?
OL,9,FAlmost all of the nations that have
OL,10,Feither called for Infantino to go
OL,11,Fimmediately or said they will not back
OL,12,Fhim at the upcoming election come from
OL,13,FEurope.
OL,15,FMany of these nations had previously
OL,16,Fendorsed him before the recent crisis.
OL,18,FFinland was among the first to
OL,19,Fwithdraw their support, followed by
OL,20,FEngland, Wales and Serbia.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
