OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FSweden, Greece, Albania, Croatia,
OL,8,FGermany, Denmark, the Netherlands and
OL,9,FNorway have all since followed suit.
OL,11,FThe Romanian and Czech associations
OL,12,Falso hinted that they will not back
OL,13,FInfantino but have not formally
OL,14,Fdeclared so.
OL,16,FThe only non-European nation to say
OL,17,Fthey will not support Infantino's re-
OL,18,Felection has been Jordan, with former
OL,19,FFifa vice president Prince Ali bin Al
OL,20,FHussein accusing the sporting body's
OL,21,Fleadership of blackmail this week.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
