OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786376899
OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FPrince Ali said the Jordanian
OL,8,Ffederation he leads has not been paid
OL,9,Fmoney for reaching the final of the
OL,10,FFifa Arab Cup played last December in
OL,11,FQatar, and claimed he was told backing
OL,12,FInfantino would "go a long way to
OL,13,Fhelping our FA out".
OL,15,FThe Jordan FA has since received all
OL,16,Fthe money, Prince Ali said on Thursday.
OL,18,FWho has backed Infantino?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
