OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FInfantino has also had his fair share
OL,8,Fof support since the outbreak of the
OL,9,Fcrisis.
OL,11,FQatar, Sri Lanka, Kuwait, Lebanon and
OL,12,FMorocco have all publicly backed him
OL,13,Fafter the FFE was withdrawn.
