OL,3,CWhich nations are backing Fifa's
OL,4,CGianni Infantino and which want him to
OL,5,Cgo?
OL,7,FThis was soon followed by DR Congo,
OL,8,FIndonesia, Bhutan, Philippines,
OL,9,FMexico, Argentina and Paraguay.
OL,11,FSeveral nations, which have been
OL,12,Fprominent backers of Infantino in the
OL,13,Fpast, have also voiced support for him
OL,14,Fin recent weeks but stopped short of
OL,15,Ffull endorsements.
OL,17,FThese include Egypt, Niger and
OL,18,FMauritania.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/9
